{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431560/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748222711\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering a haunted house, Ember is cursed to never leave. However, there is a way out, by eating the food that breaks the curse! Unfortunately, she does not know where or what the food is. She must explore and eat all of the food she can in order to find it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her journey she meets new friends who have the same curse laid upon themselves and soon finds out that they are willing to help her out in exchange for her help. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Ember be able to leave the Feast Manor, or will she be doomed to spend the rest of her life there? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feast Manor is a point and click visual novel. Explore at your own pace and interact with voluptuous girls, each with their own personality and body type. Find items and complete puzzles as you uncover the secrets to the manor! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 voluptuous girls who need help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully hand-drawn 4K visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well crafted story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles to solve and items to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery to admire your accomplishments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and a hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did I mention a cute girl who gains weight? </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Feast Manor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s